sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as Server (starting)
    participant G as RecoveryGate
    participant L as Audit trail (events.db)
    participant B as Broker
    participant P as Protection guard
    S->>G: "recovering": new orders and modifies wait (cancels pass)
    S->>L: read today's orders and fills
    S->>S: carried positions · replay each fill once · restore orders
    S->>B: the broker's order list (can't ask yet, e.g. Kite before today's login: retry every 10 s)
    B-->>S: each order's state
    Note over S,B: a working order the broker doesn't list:<br/>paper → closed with the reason (paper orders don't survive a restart)<br/>Kite → a problem, named
    S->>B: positions, per instrument and product
    B-->>S: compared with what was rebuilt
    alt no problem
        S->>G: "ok": "N orders, M fills, K carried positions"
    else any problem
        S->>G: "failed": each problem in words · trading stays paused until a person fixes it and restarts
    end
    S->>P: stops held by MockTrade that were running → one UNPROTECTED band per open position
